WEBVTT

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:42.610
Hakuoki
Demon of the Fleeting Blossom

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:47.340
Rather than live thousands of futures

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:55.020
I want to fully live this moment right now

00:00:56.390 --> 00:01:00.760
Even if we're by the abyss' edge

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:05.230
So long as I am with you as you race ahead

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.860
I will be like the dancing wind

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:10.940
Even if the irresistible blade of time

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:12.610
Tears at you until you collapse

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.240
Continue to dream and believe in the light

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.580
As you look up from time to time

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:18.910
Ah, I would take, ah, your place

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:22.280
If doing so would protect you

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:29.290
Turn into a strong gale, O my prayer

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:35.460
One strong enough to change fate right now

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:44.110
Turn into the wind of dawn, the wind that

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:48.670
Forces open the door to darkness

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:57.620
January 1868

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.650
Truth

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:37.610
Episode 13
Like a Flame

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:43.420
Please at least eat a little.

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:15.370
Ishida Medicinal Powder

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:42.700
I stare into your face

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:48.740
Illuminated by the dark red setting sun

00:21:48.740 --> 00:22:00.850
I softly wish upon the burning sky to stop time

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:12.300
You earnestly try to move forward
as you bear your sadness

00:22:12.300 --> 00:22:25.380
If possible, I want to follow
you down this rugged path

00:22:25.380 --> 00:22:32.290
The clouds flow by in the far, far distance

00:22:32.290 --> 00:22:37.660
Even if this moment lasts but a moment

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:40.760
I want to be with you

00:22:40.760 --> 00:22:51.540
The sun that dyes my heart will last forever

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:58.070
So just believe in our bonds

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:16.000
Next time
The Corridor of Setbacks
